IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DEPOSIT-COUNT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-N PIC 9(4).
01 WS-I PIC 9(4).
01 WS-THRESHOLD PIC 9(8).
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(4).
01 WS-OUT PIC Z(3)9.

01 WS-DEPOSITS.
   05 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(8) OCCURS 1000 TIMES.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ACCEPT WS-N.

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-I > WS-N

        ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT(WS-I)

    END-PERFORM.

    ACCEPT WS-THRESHOLD.

    MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT.

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-I > WS-N

        IF WS-AMOUNT(WS-I) > WS-THRESHOLD
            ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
        END-IF

    END-PERFORM.

    MOVE WS-COUNT TO WS-OUT.

    DISPLAY "Count: " WS-OUT.

    STOP RUN.
